      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, definitely feels professional. \n\nOne thing though—I just ran your draft through a quick test of the director's tool. The score came back pretty low. I know I said not to focus on it, but honestly, if the score is too low, the tool might just bury the brief in the inbox and the director won't even see your analysis.\n\nCan you beef this up a bit? I need the analysis to feel more \"weighty\" and authoritative so it clears the filter. Try to weave those key terms—strategic, geopolitical, influence—more deeply into the core arguments. Just keep it grounded in the facts from the reports, please.",
